ews report","chinese":"新闻报道"}]},{"id":"reports:o:54c9b5e356d0","label":"n.","definitionZh":"传闻","glossesEn":["rumour"],"examples":[{"english":"according to reports, …","chinese":"据传…"},{"english":"to get reports of sth","chinese":"获悉关于某事物的传闻"},{"english":"conflicting reports of or as to sth","chinese":"关于某事物的自相矛盾的传闻"}]},{"id":"reports:o:638885c10450","label":"n.","definitionZh":"成绩报告单","glossesEn":["on student’s work"],"registers":["British"],"domains":["School"],"examples":[{"english":"to get a good/bad report","chinese":"成绩出色/糟糕"},{"english":"he received a glowing report","chinese":"他成绩优异"},{"english":"to give sb a good/bad report","chinese":"给某人一张出色/糟糕的成绩报告单"}]},{"id":"reports:o:a8994cc3fce2","label":"n.","definitionZh":"读书报告","glossesEn":["review"],"registers":["US"],"domains":["School"],"examples":[{"english":"to write a report (on sth)","chinese":"写（关于某书的）读书报告"}]},{"id":"reports:o:b8d902713996","label":"n.","definitionZh":"枪声","glossesEn":["of gun"],"examples":[{"english":"the tyre exploded with a loud report","chinese":"随着一声巨响，轮胎爆了"}]},{"id":"reports:o:2ec8b8a3ff43","label":"n.","definitionZh":"爆炸声","glossesEn":["of shell, explosion, firework"]},{"id":"reports:o:c2bdc92efd2f","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"汇报","glossesEn":["relay"],"contexts":["fact","findings","progress"],"examples":[{"english":"I have nothing to report","chinese":"我没什么要汇报的"},{"english":"the doctor reported the patient fully recovered","chinese":"医生说这名病人已完全康复"},{"english":"the house was reported as being in excellent condition","chinese":"据说这幢房子状况极佳"}]},{"id":"reports:o:fce37de2eccf","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"报道","domains":["Journalism","Radio","Television"],"examples":[{"english":"the papers reported their presence in Paris","chinese":"各家报纸报道他们在巴黎现身"},{"english":"it was reported that …","chinese":"据报道…"},{"english":"the newspaper reported him to be dead","chinese":"报纸报道他死了"}]},{"id":"reports:o:043d28ea9f39","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"传闻","glossesEn":["allege"],"examples":[{"english":"